# Dreadhorde Arcanist's trigger reads "this creature's power" as it last was on the battlefield once it has left (CR 113.7a,
# 608.2h; the rulings). Faithless Looting on turn 1 discards a Lightning Bolt and a Lightning Strike (mana value 2). On turn 5
# Giant Growth makes the Arcanist 4/6; it attacks and its trigger targets the Strike. Bot2 answers with Swords to Plowshares:
# the Arcanist is exiled and Bot1 gains 4 life. As the trigger resolves the Arcanist's last known power is 4, so the Strike is
# still a legal target (its printed 1 would not allow it): it is cast for no mana at Bot2 and exiled as it resolves.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mountain
Faithless Looting
Dreadhorde Arcanist
Forest
Lightning Bolt
Lightning Strike
Giant Growth
Mountain x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Plains
Swords to Plowshares
Plains x18

