Bot2.Hand.Swords to Plowshares.Cast(Dreadhorde Arcanist)
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
? Bot1.Life = 24
Bot1.Accept
Bot1.Target(Bot2)
[T5 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
